# The Vercel deployment is the MCP endpoint and nothing else — the website is on
# GitHub Pages, and `/` here redirects there. So everything the website needs and
# the function does not stays out of the upload.
#
# Written as an exclude list rather than `*` plus exceptions: gitignore syntax
# cannot re-include a file whose name still matches a broad earlier pattern, and
# an over-eager `*` here means a function that deploys without its providers.
packs/
data/
assets/
tools/
.github/
.cache/
*.html
mcp/node_modules/
mcp/dist/
mcp/*.tgz
